    {
      "id": "npc-02-initial-conversation",
      "priority": 100,
      "portraitId": "official-neutral",
      "text": "I'm Helena Vale. You will usually find me among the **town archives**, making certain yesterday remains useful tomorrow.",
      "revealedFactIds": ["npc-02-public-role"],
      "conditions": {
        "excludedFlags": ["npc-02-first-conversation-complete"]
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "npc-02-careful-research-response",
          "text": "I would rather check a story than repeat it carelessly.",
          "targetNodeId": "npc-02-initial-careful-end",
          "affinityDelta": 1,
          "oneTime": true,
          "oneTimeRewardFlag": "npc-02-careful-reward-applied",
          "addedFlags": [
            "npc-02-first-conversation-complete",
            "npc-02-careful-research-response"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "npc-02-neighborly-response",
          "text": "I mostly hope to learn my neighbors' names.",
          "targetNodeId": "npc-02-initial-neighborly-end",
          "affinityDelta": 0,
          "oneTime": true,
          "oneTimeRewardFlag": "npc-02-neighborly-reward-applied",
          "addedFlags": [
            "npc-02-first-conversation-complete",
            "npc-02-neighborly-response"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-initial-careful-end",
      "priority": 0,
      "portraitId": "pleased",
      "text": "Good. A careful question leaves less damage than a confident mistake."
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-initial-neighborly-end",
      "priority": 0,
      "portraitId": "practiced-smile",
      "text": "A sound beginning. Names are the first index any town keeps."
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-moonflower-hint",
      "priority": 180,
      "portraitId": "pleased",
      "text": "Those would make lovely **pressed Moonflowers**. Their color marks a season more honestly than ink alone.",
      "revealedFactIds": ["npc-02-moonflower-pressing"],
      "conditions": {
        "requiredFlags": ["npc-02-first-conversation-complete"],
        "unknownFactIds": ["npc-02-moonflower-pressing"],
        "events": [
          {
            "kind": "resourceGathered",
            "subjectId": "moonflower",
            "minimumCount": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "npc-02-gift-moonflower-from-hint",
          "text": "Then please keep one for the archive.",
          "targetNodeId": "npc-02-gift-response",
          "giftRuleId": "npc-02-moonflower-gift"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-follow-up-conversation",
      "priority": 100,
      "portraitId": "official-neutral",
      "text": "Welcome back. Have you found anything in Alderwake that deserves a closer look?",
      "conditions": {
        "requiredFlags": ["npc-02-first-conversation-complete"]
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "npc-02-gift-moonflower-follow-up",
          "text": "I brought a Moonflower for your seasonal notes.",
          "targetNodeId": "npc-02-gift-response",
          "giftRuleId": "npc-02-moonflower-gift"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-gift-response",
      "priority": 0,
      "portraitId": "pleased",
      "text": "Thank you. I will press it beside today's date and credit the collector."
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-routine-archive-default",
      "priority": 10,
      "portraitId": "tired-rumpled",
      "text": "Mind the open folios, please. I **cross-check every entry** before returning a page to its box.",
      "revealedFactIds": ["npc-02-archive-practice"],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "npc-02-resume-archive-default-choice",
          "text": "I will let you continue.",
          "outcomeTag": "npc-02-resume-archive-default",
          "endsConversation": true
        },
        {
          "id": "npc-02-end-archive-default-choice",
          "text": "The light is fading; perhaps stop here for today.",
          "outcomeTag": "npc-02-end-archive-default",
          "endsConversation": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc-02-routine-archive-indexing",
      "priority": 11,
      "portraitId": "archive-work",
      "text": "One moment. This index says the volume is here, while the shelf insists otherwise.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "npc-02-resume-archive-indexing-choice",
          "text": "Keep tracing it; I can wait.",
          "outcomeTag": "npc-02-resume-archive-indexing",
          "endsConversation": true
        },
        {
          "id": "npc-02-review-archive-ledger-choice",
          "text": "I noticed a ledger reference that does not match the index.",
          "oneTime": true,
          "addedFlags": ["npc-02-archive-lead-shared"],
